        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Æthelred I, Oswiu of Derby, the king of Northumbria\n- Roles: kingship, child king\n- Events: assassination attempt, killing of Oswiu of Derby\n\nFacts:\n- Oswiu of Derby was killed before the later assassination attempt mentioned in the chunk.\n- The king held responsible for the killing of Oswiu of Derby was later targeted in an assassination attempt.\n- Æthelred I was the king of Northumbria referred to in the chunk.\n- Æthelred I possibly became king while still a child.\n- Æthelred I attempted to have the king held responsible for the killing of Oswiu of Derby assassinated.",
